diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index e5320566..4f8bdff9 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -5,6 +5,18 @@ All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
 The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/),
 and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
 
+## Unreleased
+
+### Added
+
+- Added support for multi-codepoint glyphs (graphemes), such as emoji with zero width joiners, variation selectors, and skin tone modifiers https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3930
+- Added `rich.cells.split_graphemes` and `rich.cells.split_text`
+- Added `unicode_version` parameter to low-level cell functions. Defaults to `"auto"` which reads the `UNICODE_VERSION` environment variable (or uses the latest version)
+
+### Changed
+
+- Unicode width data now comes from wcwidth, with a table per unicode version (`rich._unicode_data`), replacing `rich._cell_widths`
+
 ## [14.2.0] - 2025-10-09
 
 ### Changed
